  "title": "Gluten-Free Chickpea-Flour Chocolate Chunk Cookies with Peanut Butter and Oats",
  "description": "Chickpea flour replaces all-purpose in this cookie recipe with peanut butter, vanilla, chocolate, and oats.",
  "authors": [
    "Robin Stauffer"
  ],
